@startuml
title Automated Migration Failure and Manual Recovery

participant "Automated Migration Tool" as Tool
participant "Migration Management API" as API
database "Migration Database" as DB
participant "Workplace Support" as Support
actor User

Tool -> Tool: Start automated migration

alt Migration successful

    Tool -> API: POST /api/v1/migration-attempts\nexecutionType = automated\nresult = successful

    API -> DB: Create migration attempt
    API -> DB: Update workplace status = migrated
    DB --> API: Updated migration data

    API --> Tool: 201 Created

else Migration failed

    Tool -> API: POST /api/v1/migration-attempts\nexecutionType = automated\nresult = failed\ntechnicalError = ...

    API -> DB: Create failed migration attempt
    API -> DB: Update workplace status = manual_migration_required
    DB --> API: Updated migration data

    API --> Tool: 201 Created

    Support -> API: GET /api/v1/workplaces\n?migrationStatus=manual_migration_required

    API -> DB: Find workplaces requiring manual migration
    DB --> API: Workplace list
    API --> Support: 200 OK

    Support -> User: Contact user / take over workstation
    User --> Support: Workstation available

    Support -> Support: Remove Windows
    Support -> Support: Install Astra Linux
    Support -> Support: Restore workplace environment
    Support -> Support: Validate workplace operation

    alt Manual migration successful

        Support -> API: POST /api/v1/migration-attempts\nexecutionType = manual\nresult = successful

        API -> DB: Create manual migration attempt
        API -> DB: Update workplace status = migrated
        DB --> API: Updated migration data

        API --> Support: 201 Created

        Support --> User: Return operational workplace

    else Manual migration failed

        Support -> API: POST /api/v1/migration-attempts\nexecutionType = manual\nresult = failed\ntechnicalError = ...

        API -> DB: Create failed manual attempt
        API -> DB: Keep workplace in exception state
        DB --> API: Updated migration data

        API --> Support: 201 Created

    end
end

@enduml